  "ingredients": [
    "12 ounce flank steak",
    "1 tablespoon butter (melted)",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1/4 cup fresh parsley (chopped)",
    "3/4 cup shredded mozzarella",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "400 gram cauliflower (riced)",
    "3 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1/2 medium yellow onion (minced)",
    "1/2 medium red bell pepper (diced)",
    "1 medium jalapeno pepper (de-seeded + minced)",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1 teaspoon cumin",
    "1 tablespoon tomato paste",
    "3 tablespoon fresh cilantro (for garnish)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-steak-rollups-with-mexican-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53981-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Steak-Rollups-with-Mexican-Cauli-Rice-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, combine the melted butter, minced garlic, parsley, and salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-steak-rollups-with-mexican-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53981-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Steak-Rollups-with-Mexican-Cauli-Rice-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lay the flank steak out on a cutting board. Drizzle with the butter mixture and spread evenly.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-steak-rollups-with-mexican-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53981-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Steak-Rollups-with-Mexican-Cauli-Rice-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the shredded mozzarella cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-steak-rollups-with-mexican-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53981-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Steak-Rollups-with-Mexican-Cauli-Rice-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll up the steak and pin it with toothpicks. Cut the steak against the grain to form the rollups.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-steak-rollups-with-mexican-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53981-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Steak-Rollups-with-Mexican-Cauli-Rice-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a skillet over medium to high heat, remove the toothpicks, and add the rollups and cook until the steaks turn a nice golden color or about 3-4 minutes per side. Remove from skillet.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-steak-rollups-with-mexican-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53981-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Steak-Rollups-with-Mexican-Cauli-Rice-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "With the same skillet, add olive oil. Add in the onion, garlic, bell pepper, and jalapeno. Cook and stir until fragrant.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-steak-rollups-with-mexican-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53981-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Steak-Rollups-with-Mexican-Cauli-Rice-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in the cauliflower rice. Let cook for 3-4 minutes, stirring constantly. Add in the cumin and tomato paste. Stir well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-steak-rollups-with-mexican-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53981-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Steak-Rollups-with-Mexican-Cauli-Rice-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the steak rollups back into the pan to let them heat up again.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-steak-rollups-with-mexican-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53981-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Steak-Rollups-with-Mexican-Cauli-Rice-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with parsley. Serve and enjoy!",
